  "description": "Count the number of subtrees where all nodes have the same value.",
  "pseudocode": "1. count = 0\n2. function isUni(node):\n3.   if !node: return true\n4.   left = isUni(node.left)\n5.   right = isUni(node.right)\n6.   if left && right && (!node.left || node.val == node.left.val) && (!node.right || node.val == node.right.val):\n7.     count++\n8.     return true\n9.   return false",
